written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<ol><li>We use the Present Perfect tense for actions which started in the past and are still happening now or for finished actions which have a connection to the present.</li> <li>We use the Simple Past tense for past events or actions which have no connection to the present.</li></ol>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I have waited for a while to try dating again.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll tell her about the experiences I've had.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Rule\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Explanation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Perfect</span> is used when the time period has NOT finished.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have waited a while to try dating again.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The time period goes up to the present.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Past</span> is used when the time period HAS finished.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The experience was a bit stressful last time. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Last week has finished.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is  done.</p>  Example: She strongly voiced her concerns.</br> How did she voice her concerns? Strongly.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "This time I promise to act more enthusiastically! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Is it fair to say the last time you dated you were inadequately prepared to meet the girl? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding -ly to an adjective</br> definite \u2192 definitely </br>         \t absolute \u2192 absolutely </p> Some adverbs are formed by adding -ally</br>enthusiastic \u2192  enthusiastically</p>  These adverbs can come after the direct object or after the  verb if there isn't any direct object.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "blind date", "type": "name"}, {"content": "going out with someone you have never seen in person before", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter, do you think you're ready to try the blind date thing again?  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about a blind date.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wavy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "curly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love her wavy hair.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "well-dressed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes someone who has good clothes that are suited to the person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is very pretty and well-dressed. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "peculiar", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not usual or normal; strange, odd", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She didn't look like the photos. She had a peculiar appearance. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "enthusiastically", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling or showing strong excitement about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This time I promise to act more enthusiastically! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inadequately", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not enough or not good enough; not adequate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is it fair to say the last time you dated you were inadequately prepared?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "appearance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way a person looks", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She had a peculiar appearance. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to look like", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have a similar physical appearance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She didn't look like the photos she sent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Create a short dialogue (10-12 lines) about two people at dinner on their first date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about things you have done or haven't done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about what you like or don't like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about things I have done or haven't done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le07ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le07ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Doug</span>: Hey Peter, do you think you're ready to try the blind date thing again?  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I definitely found the experience a bit stressful last time. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Doug</span>: You can say that again!", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I was absolutely surprised. She didn't look like the photos she sent. She had a peculiar appearance. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Doug</span>: It will be better this time.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I hope so. I have waited for a while to try dating again. This time I promise to act more enthusiastically!", "time": "8600"}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Doug</span>: It should be easy. She is very pretty and well-dressed. Is it fair to say the last time you dated you were inadequately prepared to meet the girl?  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I guess you could say that. I really just want to know what she likes. You know, music, food, movies? I'll 